<!--BlockML Documentation — create or update the A02 DocSet
  FQN: org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.task.A02_UpdateDocSet-->
<task:A02_UpdateDocSet xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  xmlns:task="org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.task"
  xmlns:workflow="org.blockml.bml.transformer.workflow"
  xmlns:type="org.blockml.bml.type">

  <baseType>
    workflow:InstructionTask
  </baseType>
  <is>
    A task that creates or updates the A02 DocSet
  </is>
  <documentation>
    A02 structuring task: create or update BmlDocSet_A02 from BmlDocSetPlan.
    title, version, and summary come only from the plan. pages and pageGroups
    are declared as empty aggregations so later A02 tasks can register
    entries. This task has no authoritativeSources.
  </documentation>
  <properties>
    <instructions type="type:Text" override="true">
      <value>
        <![CDATA[
          All information for this task comes from the plan. Do not read
          authoritativeSources on this task or on BmlDocSetPlan. Do not invent
          title, version, or summary that the plan does not state.

          1. Read the plan
          Read org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a01_planning.data.BmlDocSetPlan. Collect
          title, version, and summary. Those three values are the DocSet
          identity fields this task copies. Do not walk PagePlan or
          PageGroupPlan entries. Do not create or edit pages, PageGroups,
          or pageMapping.

          2. Resolve the A02 DocSet FQN
          DocSet FQN =
          org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.data.BmlDocSet_A02
          Write only this a02 DocSet, never a DocSet outside a02 (a03 or any
          later sector). Do not edit DocSets of other sectors.

          3. Create or update BmlDocSet_A02
          If BmlDocSet_A02 already exists, keep only the FQN / file path so
          the same Block is overwritten. Refresh title, version, and summary
          from the plan. Preserve existing pages, pageGroups, homePage, and
          rootPageGroup — later A02 tasks fill those (A02_UpdatePageSkeletons
          writes pages and homePage; A02_UpdatePageGroups writes pageGroups
          and rootPageGroup). If a preserved pages or pageGroups entry is
          outside a02, remove it. Do not invent pages or groups.

          If BmlDocSet_A02 does not exist, create it as the A02 DocSet
          container. Example of the target shape:
          packages/bmldocs/blocks/org/blockml/bml/bmldocs/a02_structuring/data/BmlDocSet_A02.bml

          Each DocSet must:
          - use baseType org.blockml.bml.docgen.core.DocSet
          - use BmlDocSet_A02 as the Block name
          - set is to one short identity sentence from the plan title /
            summary (for example "The BlockML core documentation set")
          - set isNot to contrast with a single DocPage and with a bml-core
            narrative Documentation Block
          - set documentation to restate the plan summary and to name that
            pages / homePage are filled by A02_UpdatePageSkeletons and
            pageGroups / rootPageGroup by A02_UpdatePageGroups
          - override title from BmlDocSetPlan.title
          - override version from BmlDocSetPlan.version
          - override summary from BmlDocSetPlan.summary
          - declare aggregations pages and pageGroups so later A02 tasks can
            register TypeReferenceEntity links there
          - on create: leave pages and pageGroups as empty compositions;
            omit homePage and rootPageGroup
          - on update: do not empty pages or pageGroups; do not add children
            to them here
          - omit learningPaths
          - omit every other aggregation

          4. Export BmlDocSet_A02 from the catalog
          Export org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.data.BmlDocSet_A02
          from org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.Library if it is not already in the
          catalog. Do not remove catalog entries of other sectors.
        ]]>
      </value>
    </instructions>
  </properties>
</task:A02_UpdateDocSet>
